  "description": "The Zanskar series forms the foundation of our custom steel frames—built around a Reynolds 525 core and designed to be finished to your exact requirements. Each frameset is made to order, with the option to select from our standard geometry or pursue a fully custom fit.\n\nwe use full 4130 chromoly steel for both frame and fork, TIG-welded for strength, consistency, and long-term durability.\n\nThe geometry is carefully balanced between track responsiveness and everyday usability, resulting in a ride that is fast, stable, and comfortable in urban conditions.\n\nThe Zanskar Tracklocross is our fixed-gear frameset, designed with clearance for up to 37C tyres and equipped with mounts for long-reach caliper brakes, paired with a biplanar fork. This tyre clearance represents the upper limit for caliper brake compatibility. For riders opting for a brakeless setup, we can increase clearance up to 40C. A clean, minimal configuration without brake mounts or routing is also available on request.\n\nAs each frame is built individually, we can tailor the geometry and details to suit your riding style and preferences.\n\nWe offer single-tone paint finishes across our range.",
